{"id":"ca9ad86d98eb5bc2","group":"90","path":"90/90-prop-simple-immune.md","title":"Simple Set is Immune","display":"prop-simple-immune — Simple Set is Immune","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-prop-simple-immune","aliases":["90-prop-simple-immune"],"display":"prop-simple-immune — Simple Set is Immune","depends_on":["[[90-df-simple-set]]","[[90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-prop-simple-immune"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-prop-simple-immune</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-simple-immune — Simple Set is Immune"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30f3283b9dedba60\" href=\"?note=30f3283b9dedba60\" title=\"90-df-simple-set\">90-df-simple-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1316be710802d6a1\" href=\"?note=1316be710802d6a1\" title=\"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(S,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"30f3283b9dedba60\" href=\"?note=30f3283b9dedba60\" title=\"90-df-simple-set\">90-df-simple-set</a>，同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Immune}\">\\(\\mathrm{Immune}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Immune}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n[|A|=\\infty\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ (W_e\\subseteq A\\Longrightarrow|W_e|&lt;\\infty)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Simple}(S)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Immune}(\\mathbb N\\setminus S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Immune}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n[|A|=\\infty\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ (W_e\\subseteq A\\Longrightarrow|W_e|&lt;\\infty)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Simple}(S)&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Immune}(\\mathbb N\\setminus S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}(S)\\)</span>，其无限补集条件和对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 的有限性条件正是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Immune}(\\mathbb N\\setminus S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Immune}(\\mathbb N\\setminus S)\\)</span> 的两个合取项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原文件已使用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Immune}\">\\(\\mathrm{Immune}\\)</span>，将其正式放入断言而非仅在假设中说明。免疫的是补集，不是原 c.e. 集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-simple-set","status":"resolved","id":"30f3283b9dedba60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-simple-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"1316be710802d6a1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-simple-set","status":"resolved","id":"30f3283b9dedba60","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Simple}$ 见 [[90-df-simple-set]]，同一 $W_e$ 见 [[90-df-program-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Simple}$ 见 [[90-df-simple-set]]，同一 $W_e$ 见 [[90-df-program-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Simple}","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Immune}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Immune}(A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n[|A|=\\infty\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\ (W_e\\subseteq A\\Longrightarrow|W_e|<\\infty)],\\\\\n\\mathrm{Simple}(S)&\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Immune}(\\mathbb N\\setminus S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Simple}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Immune}(\\mathbb N\\setminus S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Immune}","display":false}],"bytes":1282,"backlinks":[{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-simple-set]]、[[90-prop-simple-immune]]、[[90-df-hypersimple-set]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-prop-creative-complete.md]]\n[[90-prop-essential-undecidable-implies.md]]\n[[90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable.md]]\n[[90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded.md]]\n[[90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger.md]]\n[[90-prop-representability-criterion.md]]\n[[90-prop-rosser-sentence.md]]\n[[90-prop-simple-immune.md]]"}],"outgoing":["30f3283b9dedba60","1316be710802d6a1","5d66bf24ea0c6e5a"]}